<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1551] Default interpreter is different at various places</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1551</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Create a note and check the system default interpreter in the interpreter section, it would be &quot;md&quot;. Now navigate to the interpreter page and check the default one, it would be &quot;alluxio&quot; (refer to the screenshots).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13012277">ZEPPELIN-1551</key>
            <summary>Default interpreter is different at various places</summary>
